{%- comment -%}
  Paste into Shopify admin → Settings → Notifications → Customer notifications:
  Shipping confirmation and Delivered (and Order confirmation if you want it),
  just below the main button. Opens the returns desk with the order already
  looked up. Size swap first in the wording, on purpose.
  "&amp;" not "&": Shopify's notification editor rejects a bare & in an href.
{%- endcomment -%}
<table class="row actions">
  <tr>
    <td class="empty-line">&nbsp;</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="actions__cell">
      <table class="button main-action-cell">
        <tr>
          <td class="button__cell"><a href="https://crooksldn.com/pages/returns?order={{ order_name | url_encode }}&amp;proof={{ email | url_encode }}" class="button__text">Wrong size? Swap it free</a></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
      <p style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 13px; color: #999;">Changed your mind? Returns are online too, with a QR-code label: no printer needed.</p>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
